<title>GERMANY: Porsche H1 profit surges to 38.4 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Porsche H1 profit surges to 38.4 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of the 1996/97 business year to January 31.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net-profit			   38.4    vs 10.3</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,779   vs up 25.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group unit car sales		     13,549  vs up 32.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Dr. Ing.h.c.F. Porsche AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
